# HOMESPUN: every save makes its own Wilds: the roads (a random tree with
# extra loops, some blocked for the save, some that open or close from trip
# to trip), which caves hold the three dungeons and everything else, the
# ruins and the hopstones. 200 worlds are checked: every screen reachable on
# every trip, every way into a screen open, the lair only through the
# ruins, four noodlers. The dungeons are drawn by hand and checked too.
seed 44
game homespun
wait 5
expect art_bad == 0
expect dun_check == 0
expect world_check200 == 0
expect variety30 & 1
expect variety30 & 2
expect variety30 & 4
expect variety30 & 8
expect variety30 & 16
expect variety30 & 32
# within a trip beaten foes stay beaten; a new trip brings them all back
cheat newgame 119
wait 5
cheat trip 3
expect mobs >= 2
cheat killall
expect mobs == 0
cheat goscreen 42
cheat goscreen 43
expect mobs == 0
cheat room 43 160 150
hold DOWN 20
wait 50
press A
cheat trip 3
expect mobs >= 2
